AKBER ALI AKBER HAYE AKBER ALI AKBER<br>
ZAINAB KI SADA THI MERE DILBAR ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
Maa Kheti Thi Humshakl-e-Payaimber Mere Dilbar<br>
Takti Rahi Naize Pe Tera Sar Mere Dilbar<br>
Ab kaise Jiyegi Teri Madar Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Zalim Ne Tere Sine Pe Jo Mara Hai Bhala<br>
Kya Hogi Aziyath Tujhe Allaha Wo Naiza<br>
Tuta Jo Tere Qalb Ke Ander Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Kheti Hai Har Ek Pal Mere Bhayya Mere Bhayya<br>
Takti hu Jo Usko Tho Laraz Jati Hu Beta<br>
Roti Hai Sakina Jo Tadapkar Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Athara Baras Pala Tha Maine Tujhe Beta<br>
Armaan Tha Dekhu Tuhje Bandhe Huwe Shehra<br>
Ab Jism Tera Khoon Me Hai Tar Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Kya Aala-e-Tanhai Me Rheti Hai Wo Dukhya<br>
Din Raat Tujhe Yaad Kiya Karti Hai Sughra<br>
Har Lamha Tadapti Hai wo Muztar Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Mai Souchti Hu Jake Madine Me Karu Kya<br>
Pouchegi Jo Sughra Tumhe Batlao Kahu Kya<br>
Chlata Hai Mere Qalb Pe Qanjar Ali Akber<br>
<br>
Bhulega Na Ahsan koi Iss Gham Ka Fasana<br>
Roega Rulaega Issi Gham Me Zamana<br>
Matam Tera Hoega Har Ek Ghar Ali Akber